{
 "name": "mod-puzzle-rooms-outdoor",
 "about": "mods/puzzles on outdoor floors (ForestBrush: forest and heaven), where no walled room can be carved: with puzzles.room_chance 100 a forest floor (dark_citadel) and a heaven floor (heaven_test) each get the Constellation in an open clearing (set hwp_puzzle_open, tweak/missions/hwp_puzzles_open.sval). The bot walks to it, solves it and gets the reward on both.",
 "fixture": "town-paladin",
